    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the hotlines. i've seen them. they just tell you to \"hang in there\" but they don't change the fact that i'm bankrupt and failing. you're talking about variables, but i'm looking at the reality. they deserve a life that isn't defined by my mistakes. wouldn't you agree that sometimes the most selfless thing a person can do is just stop being the problem?",
